{"description": "Tinycast — a tiny, fully native macOS launcher, hotkeys, and clipboard history.", "homepage": "https://tinycast.dev", "topics": [], "pushed_at": null, "updated_at": "2026-11-04 03:09:07", "detail": {"avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14371506?u=ec6ea926dffb43dd84e621909b5185436cd7333c&v=4", "readme": "<h1 align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://tinycast.dev\"><img src=\"docs/images/icon.png\" alt=\"Tinycast app icon\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><br>\n  Tinycast\n</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  A native macOS launcher for everyday productivity. Lightweight and open source.\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://tinycast.dev\"><strong>Website</strong></a> ·\n  <a href=\"#install\"><strong>Install</strong></a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://tinycast.dev/docs/\"><strong>Docs</strong></a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://tinycast.dev/support\"><strong>Support</strong></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/releases/latest\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/github/release/abue-ammar/tinycast.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;label=RELEASE&amp;logo=lu:Tag&amp;valueColor=60A5FA\" /><img alt=\"Latest release\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/github/release/abue-ammar/tinycast.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;label=RELEASE&amp;logo=lu:Tag&amp;valueColor=2563EB\" /></picture></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/releases\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/github/downloads/abue-ammar/tinycast.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;label=DOWNLOADS&amp;logo=lu:CloudDownload&amp;valueColor=A78BFA\" /><img alt=\"Total downloads\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/github/downloads/abue-ammar/tinycast.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;label=DOWNLOADS&amp;logo=lu:CloudDownload&amp;valueColor=7C3AED\" /></picture></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/actions/workflows/release.yml\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/github/ci/abue-ammar/tinycast.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;workflow=release.yml&amp;label=BUILD&amp;logo=lu:Hammer&amp;valueColor=4ADE80\" /><img alt=\"Release build status\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/github/ci/abue-ammar/tinycast.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;workflow=release.yml&amp;label=BUILD&amp;logo=lu:Hammer&amp;valueColor=16A34A\" /></picture></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/v2Eeb4QQy3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/DISCORD-JOIN.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;logo=discord&amp;valueColor=A5B4FC\" /><img alt=\"Join the Tinycast Discord\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/DISCORD-JOIN.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;logo=discord&amp;valueColor=5865F2\" /></picture></a>\n  <br>\n  <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/MACOS-26%2B.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;logo=apple\" /><img alt=\"macOS 26 or later\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/MACOS-26%2B.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;logo=apple\" /></picture>\n  <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/SWIFT-6.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;logo=swift&amp;valueColor=FB923C\" /><img alt=\"Swift 6\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/SWIFT-6.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;logo=swift&amp;valueColor=EA580C\" /></picture>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/LICENSE-AGPL--3.0.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;logo=lu:Scale\" /><img alt=\"License: AGPL-3.0\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/LICENSE-AGPL--3.0.svg?variant=ghost&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;logo=lu:Scale\" /></picture></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/screenshot.jpg\" alt=\"Tinycast command palette\">\n</p>\n\nBuilt with SwiftUI and AppKit. No dependencies, no Electron, no telemetry. It runs your Raycast\nextensions, too.\n\n[Explore all features →](https://tinycast.dev/#features)\n\nFor anything private, feel free to email [iabueammar@gmail.com](mailto:iabueammar@gmail.com).\n\n## Install\n\nOn an Apple silicon Mac with macOS 26 or newer:\n\n```sh\nbrew install --cask tinycast\nbrew install --cask tinycast@beta\n```\n\n- **DMG:** notarized, download from [Releases](https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/releases). Drag `Tinycast.app` to `/Applications`.\n- **Intel Mac:** install from [Homebrew tap](https://github.com/abue-ammar/homebrew-tinycast).\n\n## Support\n\nTinycast is free and stays free. If it earns a place on your Mac, consider supporting its\ndevelopment. Thank you!\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://tinycast.dev/support\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/SUPPORT-CARD.svg?variant=outline&amp;size=lg&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;logo=lu:CircleDollarSign&amp;logoColor=A78BFA&amp;valueColor=A78BFA\" /><img alt=\"Support by card payment\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/SUPPORT-CARD.svg?variant=outline&amp;size=lg&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;logo=lu:CircleDollarSign&amp;logoColor=7C3AED&amp;valueColor=7C3AED\" /></picture></a>\n  <a href=\"https://tinycast.dev/support?method=crypto\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/SUPPORT-CRYPTO.svg?variant=outline&amp;size=lg&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=dark&amp;logo=lu:Bitcoin&amp;logoColor=FBBF24&amp;valueColor=FBBF24\" /><img alt=\"Support with crypto\" src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/SUPPORT-CRYPTO.svg?variant=outline&amp;size=lg&amp;font=geist-mono&amp;mode=light&amp;logo=lu:Bitcoin&amp;logoColor=B45309&amp;valueColor=B45309\" /></picture></a>\n</p>\n\n## License\n\nTinycast is licensed under the [AGPL-3.0 license](LICENSE).\n"}}